        {
          "id": "gid://shopify/Product/8905780756677",
          "title": "EM-1 Machine",
          "handle": "em-1",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Everything machine is FOUR machines in 1. The EM-1 can be used for grinding, sanding, and polishing stones. It has a 6\" trim saw for cutting. It features attachments for metalsmiths to create jewelry, and a flexible shaft suitable for both carving and fine metal work. The arbor and motor sits on a waterproofed veneer stand with an accessory drawer.</p>\n<p>Additional special features include:</p>\n<p>Moveable Sprayers</p>\n<p>Undermount Water Filtration System</p>\n<p>Adjustable Magnifying Lens &amp; Light</p>\n<p>Patented Variable Speed Motor (1 Horsepower Variable Speed with 100% Torque)</p>\n<p>Included with purchase:</p>\n<p>6\" Bonded Diamond Wheel 80 grit</p>\n<p>6\" Bonded Diamond Wheel 220 grit</p>\n<p>6\" Resin Bond Diamond Wheel 280 grit</p>\n<p>6\" Resin Bond Diamond Wheel 600 grit</p>\n<p>6\" Resin Bond Diamond Wheel 1200 grit</p>\n<p>6\" Resin Bond Diamond Wheel 3000 grit</p>\n<p>Flex Shaft w/ 18pc accessory set and 3pc attachment heads</p>\n<p>x2 Silversmithing spindles w/ x3 sanding and polishing wheels</p>\n<p>DIALUX Superfinishing paste</p>\n<p>DIALUX Polishing paste</p>\n<p>Flat Lap w/ 6\" magnetic felt pad and 6\" magnetic 80 grit disc</p>\n<p>Magnifying Glass Attachment</p>\n<p>Jointed Light Attachment</p>\n<p>x2 Detachable Wrist rests</p>\n<p>Water Pump w/ tank filtration system</p>\n<p>Splash guards</p>\n<p>Moss Filtration Pads</p>\n<p>x2 Brass Spray Nozzles</p>\n<p>Spoke Wrench</p>\n<p>Allen Wrench/Hex key</p>\n<p>Crescent Wrench</p>",
